# Routine "Activity-window usage cadence": the template does not carry a machine-readable schedule
# (Grok Bot sets it when the routine is created/enabled).
# Cadence described in the template: - cron `@every 5m`
# Fill in the five cron fields, then add to crontab -e:
# M H DOM MON DOW cd /path/to/usage-bot && pi -p "/activity-window-usage-cadence"
